       ally  called  from  a package's post-removal script when that script is
       given the ppuurrggee argument.  Any files in the //eettcc//rrcc_r_u_n_l_e_v_e_l..dd  directo‐
       ries that are not symbolic links to the script //eettcc//iinniitt..dd//_n_a_m_e will be
